{"notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Source title: Het smelt (Dutch Edition)"}, "identifiers": {"wikidata": ["Q63367736"]}, "title": "Het smelt", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL7399548A"}], "publish_date": "Nov 20, 2015", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "source_records": ["amazon:9082410613", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_026.bib.mrc:434956:1549"], "publishers": ["Das Mag Uitgeverij B.V."], "isbn_10": ["9082410613"], "isbn_13": ["9789082410617"], "physical_format": "paperback", "covers": [13303384], "key": "/books/OL46543686M", "number_of_pages": 480, "works": [{"key": "/works/OL34323377W"}], "lc_classifications": ["PT5882.29.P58 S64 2016"], "oclc_numbers": ["940692481"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/dut"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "1988 is een bijzonder jaar voor het kleine, Vlaamse Bovenmeer: behalve Eva worden er slechts twee andere kinderen geboren, Pim en Laurens. De drie maken er hun hele jeugd samen het beste van. Tot de bloedhete zomer van 2002; de jongens worden pubers met snode plannen. De verlegen Eva kan meedoen of oprotten. Die keuze is geen keuze."}, "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-02-11T17:43:20.158890"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-12-14T20:54:06.909138"}}